WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Taps and holds land on a sloping line beneath a large triangle ring, with heart-tipped bars at the top of the field.

00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
The line tilts steeply and short bars fall towards it from both sides.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.000
The lines turn vertical and notes arrive on them from above and below.

00:15.000 --> 00:20.000
Two square frames open at the top while a note bursts on a vertical line.

00:20.000 --> 00:25.000
Notes scatter around a tilted line as a long hold slides across it.

00:25.000 --> 00:30.000
Taps burst at both ends of a level line.

00:30.000 --> 00:40.000
Notes land low on the field while white bars cross above them.

00:40.000 --> 00:46.000
Lines fan out across the whole field around the ring.

00:46.000 --> 00:50.000
The whole field freezes: the notes turn grey and a pause glyph appears in the centre.
